    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to FluffyInn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the adorable customers can be petted and booped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/f7a8e3e253e489ed10b1f48db5f2bd63.poster.avif?t=1750310247\" width=800 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/f7a8e3e253e489ed10b1f48db5f2bd63.webm?t=1750310247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock more customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After meeting the corresponding conditions, new customers can be invited to come. Can you fufill their demanding requirements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/9f17aebd91e3a281f3c9c7fea977dde3.poster.avif?t=1750310247\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/9f17aebd91e3a281f3c9c7fea977dde3.webm?t=1750310247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beautiful and fun facilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and purchase various facilities, decorate your own personalized inn, and bring more fun to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/2e53630b7d87ccf0315bf7fc0811b866.poster.avif?t=1750310247\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/2e53630b7d87ccf0315bf7fc0811b866.webm?t=1750310247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/2e53630b7d87ccf0315bf7fc0811b866.mp4?t=1750310247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delightful and relaxing playing experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No event requires immediate actions, you can focus on other work without keeping an eye on the business situation, the staff will\u00a0make all things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing with these cuties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/76fff8bb55525c919e562e9dbb92f022.poster.avif?t=1750310247\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/76fff8bb55525c919e562e9dbb92f022.webm?t=1750310247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Team\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WittyDoma\u00a0 \u00a0\u5409\u5409\u8fbe\u00a0 \u00a0\u6b63\u7279\u9e45</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>*We use AI for translation</i></strong></p>",
